# ComfyUI-Workflow-Studio - Unsloth backend (AI TOOL tab / sidebar A tab)
#
# Unsloth Desktop requires an API key even for local access
# (Settings -> API in the Unsloth app, shown only once when issued).
#
# Alternatively leave the key empty and turn on Keyless API access ->
# "Chat and inference" in Unsloth Desktop's Settings -> API; requests are then
# sent without a key. That setting also serves your private LAN, and keep
# "Allow tools" OFF.
#
# 1. Copy this file to ".env" (same directory as this example file)
# 2. Paste your key after the "=" below (do NOT add a leading #, or the
#    line becomes a comment and the key will not be loaded)
# 3. Restart ComfyUI

UNSLOTH_API_KEY=
